# Filter / Search Behavior

- Search trigger: when clicking the `Search` button, perform the search.
- Search trigger: when pressing `Enter` inside any filter textbox, perform the search.
- Refetch behavior: every click/search action must call the API again, even if the params are the same as the previous request.
- Clear behavior: when the user clears filters, reset them back to the default values.
